msgid "Borrow, completion and observer lifetime"
msgstr "借用、完成与 observer 生命周期"

msgid "The caller owns request and buffer storage. Accepted asynchronous I/O borrows it; rejection does not. Cancellation, a deadline or a failed stop cannot revoke that borrow. This separation prevents IRQ/DMA or an executor from accessing recycled memory. The [lifecycle contract](../design/next-generation-platform.md) and public operation declarations define exact context and result behavior."
msgstr "调用方拥有请求与缓冲区存储。已接受异步 I/O 借用存储；拒绝不借用。取消、deadline 或失败 stop 都不能撤销借用。这防止 IRQ/DMA 或 executor 访问已复用内存。[生命周期合同](../design/next-generation-platform.md)和公共操作声明定义精确上下文与结果行为。"

