msgid "Current borrowed request state and settlement proof obligations"
msgstr "当前借用请求状态与最终结束证明义务"

msgid "FIG-06 does not treat REJECTED/ACCEPTED as request-state enum members. Core helpers cannot observe a peripheral's physical drain; the provider must establish that proof before publishing settlement."
msgstr "FIG-06 不把 REJECTED/ACCEPTED 当成请求状态枚举。Core helper 不能观察外设物理排空；provider 必须先建立证明，才能发布结束。"

msgid "Three different completion facts"
msgstr "三种不同的完成事实"

msgid "![Current UART and SPI memory, wire and final-publication order](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"
msgstr "![当前 UART/SPI 内存、线上与最终发布顺序](../assets/diagrams/dma-completion.svg)"

msgid "Current UART and SPI memory, wire and final-publication order"
msgstr "当前 UART/SPI 内存、线上与最终发布顺序"

msgid "FIG-07 separates memory completion, wire completion and final publication. UART TC is not NDTR zero; SPI idle and CS interval are not a DMA interrupt. Disable and detach the actual IRQ/DMA/queue references before release-publication of SETTLED. The caller's acquire observation then exposes the final result/count. A timeout result can be final only after this lifecycle, not at deadline expiry."
msgstr "FIG-07 分开内存完成、线上完成与最终发布。UART TC 不是 NDTR 为零；SPI idle 和 CS interval 不是 DMA 中断。Release 发布 SETTLED 前，必须关闭并解除实际 IRQ/DMA/queue 引用。调用方 acquire 观察后才能取得最终 result/count。Timeout 结果只有经过这一生命周期才能最终成立，不能在 deadline 到达时直接认定。"

msgid "Cross-task control and continuous streams"
msgstr "跨任务控制与连续流"

msgid "Use stable slots plus monotonically increasing epochs for remote control. Do not send a raw pointer to storage another task can recycle. Detach control/observer references and join observers before releasing the slot and preparing the next request. A generation counter detects stale identity but does not itself join a task."
msgstr "远程控制使用稳定 slot 和单调递增 epoch。不得传递另一任务能够复用存储的裸指针。释放 slot 并准备下一请求前，必须解除 control/observer 引用并 join observer。代次计数可检测过期身份，但自身不会 join 任务。"

msgid "Continuous receive and ADC use explicit caller-owned block loans. A consumer keeps a block immutable until matching release. The producer needs a replacement target before publishing an old hardware bank. No replacement means visible stop/backpressure; it must never overwrite a consumer. Stop waits for filling, ready and borrowed blocks, not just active DMA. [The stream contract](../design/io-observation-recovery.md) records what loss counters and software timestamps do and do not prove."
msgstr "连续接收与 ADC 使用调用方显式拥有的 block loan。消费者保持 block 不可变，直到匹配 release。Producer 发布旧硬件 bank 前需要 replacement target。没有 replacement 就可见地停止/背压，绝不能覆写消费者。Stop 等待 filling、ready 和 borrowed block，而不仅是 active DMA。[流合同](../design/io-observation-recovery.md)记录 loss counter 和软件 timestamp 能证明与不能证明的范围。"

msgid "![Current continuous block producer, replacement and loan drain](../assets/diagrams/continuous-stream.svg)"
msgstr "![当前连续 block producer、替换与借用块排空](../assets/diagrams/continuous-stream.svg)"

msgid "Current continuous block producer, replacement and loan drain"
msgstr "当前连续 block producer、替换与借用块排空"

msgid "FIG-15 includes observable loss and stop/drain responsibilities. Capacity and service-latency budgets are explicit product inputs; arbitrary IRQ delay or consumer speed cannot be promised lossless. The [tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md) executes rejection and quarantine; [OS shutdown](../guides/os-shutdown.md) explains wait and join responsibilities."
msgstr "FIG-15 包括可见 loss 和 stop/drain 责任。容量与 service-latency 预算是明确的产品输入；不能承诺任意 IRQ 延迟或消费者速度下无损。[教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)执行拒绝和隔离；[OS 停机](../guides/os-shutdown.md)说明等待与 join 责任。"

